# `/credits` while a turn is still streaming (slow-turns.json: a chunk every
# 250 ms for about eight seconds): `during` is the screen a second after it
# was run, with the turn still going; `after` once the turn has ended.
credits credits-ok.json
gateway slow-turns.json
wait 2.5
type explain the plan please
key Enter
wait 1.5
type /credits
key Enter
wait 1
snap during
wait 9
snap after
gwlog
